            "description": {
              "value": "A trail of energy flows from your target back to you. Make a SoM with a ranged weapon or ranged unarmed attack against a target within the ranged weapon or unarmed attack's first range increment. The spell you cast for the SoM can't be a cantrip or focus spell. Each creature in a line between you and the target, excluding you and the targer, takes damage equal to double the spell's level.\n\nDetermine the damage type as described in SoM."
